  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MRG seminarier i Strasbou</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRG seminars in Strasbour</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Minority Rights Group ska genomf&#xf6;ra utbildning kring Europar&#xe5;dets konvention om minoritetsr&#xe4;ttigheter. Utbildningen &#xe4;r riktad till lokala aktivister fr&#xe5;n Balkan och omfattar &#xe4;ven uppf&#xf6;ljningsprojekt och utv&#xe4;rdering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Minority Rights Group will conduct a training on the Council of Europe&apos;s Framework Convention for the Protection of National Minorities. The training is geared towards local activists from the Balkans and includes follow-up projects as well as evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
